Package: agrillm
Title: Large Language Models for Agricultural Applications
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bangyou", "Zheng", email = "zheng.bangyou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools and utilities for applying Large Language Models 
    to agricultural research and practice. The framework integrates in the Agricultural 
    Production Systems sIMulator ('APSIM') Next Generation with Artificial Intelligence assisted decision 
    support for transparent, interpretable agricultural 
    decision-making. See Zheng et al. (2026) for the underlying methodology and framework.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://agrillm.bangyou.me/,
    https://github.com/byzheng/agrillm
BugReports: https://github.com/byzheng/agrillm/issues
References: 
    Zheng B, Kikuchi Y, Wang E, Verburg K (2026).
    A transparent crop model-driven and AI-assisted framework for agricultural decision support.
    Climate Smart Agriculture, 3, 100143.
    https://doi.org/10.1016/j.csag.2026.100143
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
